      "content": "\"stop participating in the performance\"... what does that even mean? like, just ignoring everyone? it's not that easy. they won't just let me be. it feels like the only way to actually stop the performance is to just... not be here at all. like, if i wasn't even part of this world, then the expectations wouldn't matter. is that a crazy way to think?",
